# Python bytecode. The scripts/*.py files are development-only oracles and are
# never imported by the package -- scripts/ is not in package.json "files", so
# nothing there reaches npm -- but importing one from a REPL or a harness leaves
# a __pycache__ behind that must not be committed.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo